CLASS RedInfluence : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -3* MC / (5 (TerraformRating - 10) MAX 5), PROD[1 MC / Influence]\n}\n\nCLASS WorldGovernmentDirectives : GePartyDistant<Unity>, GePartyCurrent<MarsFirst> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<Revolution>>\n}\n\nCLASS Revolution : GlobalEffect {\n  This IF MultiplayerMode, Me@Player(HAS 1 (EarthTag OR Influence), HAS =1 (RANK Ranked@Player { EarthTag<Ranked@> OR Influence<Ranked@> })): -2* TerraformRating\n  This IF MultiplayerMode, Me@Player(HAS 1 (EarthTag OR Influence), HAS =2 (RANK Ranked@Player { EarthTag<Ranked@> OR Influence<Ranked@> })): -TerraformRating*\n  This IF SoloMode, Me@Player(HAS 4 (EarthTag OR Influence)): -2* TerraformRating\n}\n\nCLASS IndependenceMovement : GePartyDistant<MarsFirst>, GePartyCurrent<Reds> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<Riots>>\n}\n\nCLASS Riots : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -4* MC / (CityTile MAX 5 - Influence)\n}\n\nCLASS CorporateAlliance : GePartyDistant<Unity>, GePartyCurrent<Reds> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SabotageGlobalEffect>>\n}\n\nCLASS SabotageGlobalEffect : GlobalEffect {\n  This: PROD[-Steel*, -Energy*], Steel / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS ExploreFirstDirective : GePartyDistant<Reds>, GePartyCurrent<Scientists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<ScientificCommunity>>\n}\n\nCLASS ScientificCommunity : GlobalEffect {\n  This: 1 MC / ProjectCard, 1 MC / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS MoholeLakeGlobalEvent : GePartyDistant<Kelvinists>, GePartyCurrent<Kelvinists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SnowCover>>\n}\n\nCLASS SnowCover : GlobalEffect {\n  This IF StartToken, GpIncomplete<Class<TemperatureStep>>: -2 TemperatureStep BY Admin\n  This: ProjectCard / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS IncreasedInterplanetaryTrade : GePartyDistant<Unity>, GePartyCurrent<Kelvinists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SolarFlare>>\n}\n\nCLASS SolarFlare : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -3* MC / (SpaceTag MAX 5 - Influence)\n}\n\nCLASS AiResearch : GePartyDistant<Scientists>, GePartyCurrent<MarsFirst> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SolarnetShutdown>>\n}\n\nCLASS SolarnetShutdown : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -3* MC / (ActiveCard MAX 5 - Influence)\n}\n\nCLASS BioengineeringBoom : GePartyDistant<Greens>, GePartyCurrent<Scientists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SpinOffProducts>>\n}\n\nCLASS SpinOffProducts : GlobalEffect {\n  This: 2 MC / ScienceTag MAX 5, 2 MC / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS ScienceSummit : GePartyDistant<Scientists>, GePartyCurrent<Greens> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SponsoredProjects>>\n}\n\nCLASS SponsoredProjects : GlobalEffect {\n  This IF StartToken: EACH Card@ResourceCard<Anyone>(HAS CardResource) { CardResource<Card@> BY Admin }\n  This: ProjectCard / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS MoralMovement : GePartyDistant<Reds>, GePartyCurrent<MarsFirst> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<StrongSociety>>\n}\n\nCLASS StrongSociety : GlobalEffect {\n  This: 2 MC / CityTile MAX 5, 2 MC / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS LocalTerraformingSupport : GePartyDistant<MarsFirst>, GePartyCurrent<Scientists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<SuccessfulOrganisms>>\n}\n\nCLASS SuccessfulOrganisms : GlobalEffect {\n  This: Plant / PROD[Plant] MAX 5, Plant / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS PateraBoring : GePartyDistant<Scientists>, GePartyCurrent<Kelvinists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<VolcanicEruptions>>\n}\n\nCLASS VolcanicEruptions : GlobalEffect {\n  This IF StartToken: 2 TemperatureStep BY Admin\n  This: PROD[Heat / Influence]\n}\n\nCLASS SeparatistMovement : GePartyDistant<MarsFirst>, GePartyCurrent<Kelvinists> {\n  Current<This>: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<WarOnEarth>>\n}\n\nCLASS WarOnEarth : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -TerraformRating* / (4 - Influence)\n}\n",
